From 4dfef8b3c11c53a074efa1b0e32493d2fbd4471c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:32:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 4a: expense model, Manager Expenses page, cashier Log
 Expense

Adds the reworked Expense model (typeId 14, new box finance_expenses_box),
an ExpenseRepository that enforces the handoff rules (amount above zero,
active category, no edit, no delete, void needs a reason), pure-Dart
totals in integer minor units, a shared entry form with a dropdown reset
key, the Manager Expenses page (date and category filters, totals,
monthly totals, add, void), the read-only cashier Log Expense page and a
LogExpenseAction button that obeys "Allow cashiers to log expenses".

Existing files touched: lib/features/finance/finance_boxes.dart (register
typeId 14, open and back up the new box) and
lib/features/finance/widgets/finance_hub_card.dart (Expenses button).
No file outside lib/features/finance and test/ is changed. The old
Expense (typeId 5), its box and the ledger export are untouched; they are
removed in phase 4b.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
